<title>FINLAND: Amer to keep strategy, listing, CEO - Moyne.</title>
<headline>Amer to keep strategy, listing, CEO - Moyne.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The buyer of a majority in Finnish sporting goods group Amer-yhtyma Oy said on Monday the company's strategy and bourse listing would remain intact, and CEO Roger Talermo would keep his job.</p>
<p>&quot;The buyer's intention is to maintain the same strategic basis as the company has done,&quot; Jonathan Bryan Guinness, the third Lord Moyne, said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The buyer's intention is to keep Amer a publically quoted company,&quot; he said. &quot;The company's CEO Roger Talermo will continue in his present position,&quot; Lord Moyne added.</p>
</text>
